sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Model adapter
    participant X as Tool executor
    participant S as Source snapshot
    M->>X: Request source ID and range
    X->>X: Validate name and fields
    alt Valid read
        X->>S: Read exact slice
        S-->>M: Text and next offset
    else Invalid call
        X-->>M: Error code and repair detail
    end
    M->>X: Propose quote and offsets
    X->>S: Verify exact span and scope
